Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:11.99,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,0)\pos(390,226)\fax-.07}George Eliot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.50,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs12\c&H7F6428&\3c&HB08F4D&\shad0\fscy150\fay-.09\frx4\fry350\move(400,150,310,113)}Advanced Nurturing High School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:26.42,Main_Top,Hasebe,0,0,0,,You want some snacks, Airi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:27.96,Main_Top,Kushida,0,0,0,,Oh, what pretty scenery!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:29.03,Main_Top,Sakura,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks, Haruka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:30.37,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,We're going fairly deep into the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:34.03,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I bet there's nothing there, \Nlike with the island island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.49,0:00:34.68,Main_Top,Inogashira,0,0,0,,Want to play cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:37.09,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Hey, they say the communal \Nbath uses natural hot springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:37.09,Main_Top,Wang,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, I've got some.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.09,0:00:38.46,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:40.60,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Is it mixed bathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.89,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Hey, let's not get ahead of ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:44.02,Main_Top,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Hey, someone up front's \Nbeing really annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:46.07,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down, Sudo-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:46.37,Main_Top,Matsushita,0,0,0,,Oh, I bet it's Ike-kun and those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:48.61,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Sorry, Suzune.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:52.19,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,I'm nervous having the \Nupperclassmen here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.89,0:00:50.87,Main_Top,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hah, Sudo got yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:52.19,Main_Top,Hirata,0,0,0,,Stop it, Yamauchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.19,0:00:55.65,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, since we don't interact \Nwith them most times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.57,0:00:56.62,Main_Top,Koenji,0,0,0,,Ah, what a pleasant nap that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:59.32,Main_Top,Kushida,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're having fun up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.62,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt the fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.62,0:01:03.12,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,but I need you to quiet down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:06.91,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,You, the students of Class D...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.14,0:01:13.58,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Excuse me. You're Class C now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.23,0:01:17.01,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Then for you, my newly advanced class,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:19.41,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,I'll explain the coming special exam:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:22.39,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,the "mixed training camp."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.02,0:01:34.03,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,It's so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:37.03,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Wow, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.77,0:01:40.37,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,We're spending a whole week here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:44.48,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Having to live and work \Nwith some other class...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:46.59,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Dunno if I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.25,0:01:51.50,Flashback,Chabashira,0,0,0,,The purpose of this special \Nexam is to use a training camp
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:54.65,Flashback,Chabashira,0,0,0,,to inspire, primarily, mental growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:58.80,Flashback,Chabashira,0,0,0,,You'll be grouped with people you \Nwouldn't normally interact with,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:00.80,Flashback,Chabashira,0,0,0,,and live together there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:02.62,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,"Mixed training camp."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.09,0:02:04.48,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,As the name suggests,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.48,0:02:09.38,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,it's a special exam in which we're split \Nalong class year and gender lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:11.87,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,then put into small groups of \Nplayers from mixed classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:15.31,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,and subsequently graded as those groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:19.32,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Whether or not we pass is determined
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:22.36,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,by four tests conducted on the last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:23.33,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(20,20)\fs12\c&H6D6B65&\3c&HEEEEEC&\shad0}1.) Zen\N A meditation test will be conducted in the dojo.\NGrading will be based on etiquette and posture.\N 2.) Written Exam\NA written test primarily about morality will be conducted.\NGrading will be based on test scores.\N 3.) Speech\N Every member of the group will give a speech.\NGrading will be based on four criteria:\N"Volume," "Posture," "Content," "Delivery."\N 4.) Marathon\N All groups will participate in a relay marathon.\NGrading will be based on placement and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:30.00,Flashback,Yukimura,0,0,0,,High-scoring groups will receive \Nclass points and private points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.84,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,But that's not the important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:33.68,Flashback,Hirata,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:36.61,Flashback,Hirata,0,0,0,,What you really have to avoid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:38.72,Flashback,Hirata,0,0,0,,is falling under the borderline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:42.61,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,Groups that fall short of the \Nborderline will see their leader
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:46.35,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,and one person named by said leader expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:49.35,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,You have to share responsibility \Nand go down with them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:51.48,Flashback,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,You might be in trouble, Sudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.14,Flashback,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,You've got such a bad attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:53.87,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:56.61,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,I've been making a real \Neffort lately, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:02.25,Flashback,Hirata,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone from \Nour class be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:05.74,Flashback,Hirata,0,0,0,,If you ever find yourself struggling, \Nfeel free to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:08.79,Flashback,Hasebe,0,0,0,,But how are we supposed to talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:11.87,Flashback,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Boys and girls are separated, \Nexcept for at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.87,0:03:14.75,Flashback,Miyake,0,0,0,,They'll be confiscating these, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:19.83,Flashback,Hirata,0,0,0,,Yeah, so I think we should have a central \Nconsultant for the girls, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:23.27,Flashback,Hirata,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to take \Nthat role, Horikita-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:24.90,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:28.43,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,But while I hesitate to admit to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.43,0:03:33.02,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I have an appropriate \Npersonality for assisting others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:35.97,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't admit to that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.39,0:03:38.78,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,So, Kushida-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:42.00,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'd like you to serve as sub-leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:46.45,Flashback,Kushida,0,0,0,,I-I'm not sure how helpful I could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:47.82,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:51.21,Flashback,Horikita,0,0,0,,Everyone in the class trusts you, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:52.76,Flashback,Kushida,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:57.60,Flashback,Kushida,0,0,0,,Sure! If I'm the one you want, \NI'll do my best to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:02.87,Main_Top,Manabe,0,0,0,,There's seriously nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:04.70,Main_Top,Girl,0,0,0,,This is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:05.06,Main_Top,Yabu,0,0,0,,And they're taking our phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.55,Main_Top,Girl,0,0,0,,I wanna go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:11.66,Main,Guide,0,0,0,,Keep it going! Keep it going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:18.17,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Seems like Class A is already \Narranging something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:23.26,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Class C, I'm taking your phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:27.28,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,I want all of you to hand them \Nover and sign the check sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.80,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(300.667,156)\frz12.47\c&HFFFDFC&\3c&H876551&\shad0\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\blur2}Sender: A
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.80,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz12.47\c&HFFFDFC&\3c&H876551&\shad0\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\blur2\pos(258.667,206)}Cancel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.80,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz12.47\c&H6AD574&\3c&H876551&\shad0\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\blur2\pos(358.667,180.666)}Accept
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:35.17,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,For this exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:38.84,Main_Top,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I wonder if the groups will \Nbe graded on a pass/fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:40.00,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,it won't be possible for me to protect \Neveryone in the class by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.84,Main_Top,Miyake,0,0,0,,I guess that's when the battle starts, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:42.92,Main_Top,Guide,0,0,0,,Third-year bus coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:44.63,Main_Top,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'm nervous being separated from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:46.45,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll have to narrow down who I protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:46.45,Main_Top,Guide,0,0,0,,Students in the parking space, please move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:46.45,Main_Top,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm sure it'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:48.64,Main_Top,2nd Year Girl,0,0,0,,We'll do just what you told us, Nagumo-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:50.26,Main_Top,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Thanks, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.39,Main_Top,2nd Year Girl,0,0,0,,You work hard, too, Nagumo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:56.73,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,We're going to take our \Nluggage into the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:05:00.46,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,There, you'll divide along gender \Nlines and break up into groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:04.90,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,We'll leave the group division up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:07.97,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,The school will not get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.23,0:05:13.16,Main_Top,Mashima,0,0,0,,The group must talk among \Nthemselves and choose a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:10.74,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,So they're leaving the whole thing to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:14.58,Main,Shibata,0,0,0,,I'd rather not be in a group with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.96,Main_Top,Mashima,0,0,0,,If you're unable to choose a leader, \Nyou'll be automatically disqualified,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:19.29,Main_Top,Mashima,0,0,0,,meaning you will be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:18.92,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Ryuen Kakeru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:21.09,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Since that time he lost to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:25.01,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,the tyrant of the former Class C \Nvoluntarily relinquished his throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:32.43,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Since then, he's been a pariah to Class D... \Nrather, our entire grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:36.77,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Ryuen-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:40.15,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,We'll start with the first-years. \NGet that luggage moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:44.13,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,We gotta climb a mountain \Ncarrying all that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:46.63,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hey, girls, you'd better help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:48.09,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Horikita-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:52.34,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Once the groups are decided, \Nwould you like to have a competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:56.51,Main,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:59.98,Main,Tachibana,0,0,0,,What's the point of a second-year \Ncompeting with a third-year?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:06.78,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,All I want is a battle between the current \Nand former student council presidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.11,0:06:13.23,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Before you go on and graduate, \NI want to find out if I've surpassed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:18.00,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,What's the nature of the competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.91,Main,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Horikita-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.91,0:06:24.29,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Whose group gets the higher average score.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:25.67,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Simple, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:27.34,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:29.59,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to take your wager, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:32.68,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,But don't get the other \Nstudents mixed up in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:35.51,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,An honorable duel, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.51,0:06:36.93,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:40.31,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,There'll be no punishment for losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:43.94,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,We're fighting for pride, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:48.40,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,My brother accepted his challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:52.45,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The current student council \Npresident, Nagumo Miyabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:56.41,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,He appears rather confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.09,0:07:15.72,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Hey, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:18.01,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,It's a pretty small room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:22.27,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,So we're staying in here with nine others?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:24.98,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Well, let's all get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.69,0:07:27.86,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,I'm taking the end, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:28.98,Main,Moriyama,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:30.90,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,Hey! You can't just call it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:33.11,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Yeah, we need to talk this over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:35.45,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Huh? What was that, Yukimura?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:39.62,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Don't order me around just 'cause \Nyou got picked for group lea—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:50.34,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I guess that whole thing cowed him somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:56.84,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,I'll gladly take the center, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:01.22,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:05.06,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,He just said we had to talk it out, Koenji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:07.98,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,This is my best position.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:11.07,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,The rest of you should choose \Nwherever you like, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:13.44,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,What happened to talking it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:17.57,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I guess we've got choppy seas ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:21.12,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Something you want to say, Yahiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:23.75,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,I shouldn't even need to say it, Hashimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:27.21,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,We might both be in Class A, \Nbut I still don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:29.17,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:31.21,Main_Top,Moriyama,0,0,0,,Hey, don't hog all the futons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:32.63,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,But we're currently allies in the same group.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:32.63,Main_Top,Koenji,0,0,0,,The answer is no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:34.63,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:36.05,Main_Top,Sumida,0,0,0,,At least lay them parallel to the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:38.01,Main_Top,Koenji,0,0,0,,That's another no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:40.22,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We're a band of ruffians, \Nunlike the other groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.01,0:08:40.55,Main_Top,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Don't make trouble for the other classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:43.85,Main_Top,Koenji,0,0,0,,I don't wish to have trouble \Nmade for me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:43.85,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,There's no room to form bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:02.33,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't usually see you so tired, Ichinose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:04.66,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Oh, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:06.08,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:10.21,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Sorry. Divvying up the \Ngroups was pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:14.09,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Girls aren't shy about saying \Nwho they don't like, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:15.84,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Don't take on too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:18.01,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Hey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.01,0:09:20.59,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,My endurance is the one \Nthing I've got going for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:22.85,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Speaking of...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.85,0:09:27.35,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Having the boys and girls only \Nget together in the cafeteria...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:30.23,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You can really feel the \Nschool's hand at work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:32.23,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Their hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:33.32,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:37.44,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It feels like a field prepared \Nespecially for sharing information
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:39.24,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,and giving directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.07,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:42.99,Main,Shiranami,0,0,0,,Honami-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.99,0:09:45.24,Main,Shiranami,0,0,0,,I could use your advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.24,0:09:47.79,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Sure! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:56.46,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The most powerful students here are those \Nwith the best communication skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:58.63,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,and who others trust the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:03.22,Main,Other Class Girl A,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Kushida-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:04.85,Main,Other Class Girl A,0,0,0,,Want to eat with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:10.60,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm talking shop about \Nour class with Horikita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:12.60,Main,Other Class Girl B,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:14.15,Main,Other Class Girl A,0,0,0,,Another time, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:21.86,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,So, did you force me into your \Ngroup to keep an eye on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.91,0:10:27.79,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Or because you want me to \Nacknowledge you as an ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:31.87,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yes, I won't deny that \Nbeing part of my motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:36.63,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you'll accept that \Nit's completely futile, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:39.38,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I want you to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:42.43,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,That's very honest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.18,0:10:47.51,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't think \Nthat's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:51.27,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm never going to tell other \Npeople about your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:53.52,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'd have nothing to gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:55.36,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Yeah, you might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:11:00.74,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,If I were to get desperate and destroy the \Nclass like I did back in middle school,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:04.03,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,it'd make it really hard \Nfor you to reach Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:04.82,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Then—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:05.78,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:09.12,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,The current situation \Nis very stifling for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:11.46,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,If someone put a knife \Nto your throat and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:15.79,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,"I won't hurt you, so help me out," \Nwould you really want to play along?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:17.88,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:22.09,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,That's why I think you could \Nbe a real asset to the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:23.80,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,The others would be more grateful—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:28.81,Main_Top,Kushida,0,0,0,,Do you not get how much it ticks me off \Nwhen you talk down to me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.89,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I'll be a good girl for a while, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:38.11,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,But until one of us leaves \Nthis school, Horikita-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:40.40,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,we're never going to see \Neye to eye about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:47.82,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm powerless, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:51.08,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,How can I be more like my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:10.39,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.60,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,That's so grating...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:17.40,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,They're waking us up this early, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:19.77,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Hey, Koenji's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:20.90,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Where'd he get off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:25.86,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,If we're missing anyone at morning roll call,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.86,0:12:27.41,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,it'll mean a point deduction!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.62,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Hey, all! Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:35.75,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Is there anything more refreshing \Nthan early morning training?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:37.75,Main,Sumida,0,0,0,,Training?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.75,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You'd better not go running \Noff on your own again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:43.46,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sick of your high-and-mighty act.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:48.76,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Rather than chastising me, \Nshouldn't you be heading for roll call?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:51.26,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,You anachronistic idea of a delinquent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:53.72,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You want a fight, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.72,0:12:55.52,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Save your fighting for later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:59.19,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Shut up! He's the one \Nwho's gonna make us late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.11,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,You're such a simpleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:03.73,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,This is why you got demoted to Class D.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.73,0:13:05.19,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:08.20,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Why don't we calm down a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:11.62,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,If anything's broken in the fight, \Nwe'll be held responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:14.33,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,And if anyone gets a black eye, \Nwe'll have to account for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.33,0:13:15.37,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:20.04,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Now, the one with the glasses. \NWhat was your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:21.54,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Yukimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:25.21,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Yeah, Yukimura-kun's right. \NWe're low on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:29.72,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Let's eat our breakfast, and if you're still \Nunhappy, you can do what you like then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.05,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:36.31,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You've got a stay of execution, Koenji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.31,0:13:37.98,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Oh, thank heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:40.56,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,I'm a pacifist, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.69,0:13:44.40,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's get to roll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:48.86,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No wonder he's considered \NSakayanagi's right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:50.99,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,His leadership is outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:57.58,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We start with a major \Ncleaning of the facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:03.13,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Not just the interior, \Nbut the grounds, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:11.59,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Then meditation in the name \Nof spiritual cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.09,0:14:17.60,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's only for a short time, but our posture \Nand etiquette are tightly monitored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:22.35,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Unfamiliar group activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:25.11,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Unfamiliar special classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:28.61,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's only natural that it \Nwould exhaust some students.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:48.76,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,I'm so tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:54.64,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Wang Mei-yu-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.30,0:14:58.22,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, er...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:15:00.43,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Shiina-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:04.40,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Being nervous is just going \Nto make you more tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:09.15,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,You're already surrounded with \Npeople you rarely interact with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:12.78,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,W-Well, I wouldn't say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:15.70,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Even if they've told us \Nto just get along now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.91,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,it's bound to be a little disorienting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:21.54,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah, Shiina-san's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:24.79,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,If you try to climb a wall before \Nyou're ready, you'll just fall off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:28.21,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,What a funny phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:32.01,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,So let's work little by little \Nto match up our paces, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:33.30,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:36.39,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ichinose-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:39.35,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Hey, no need to be that formal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.35,0:15:43.52,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,How about if you call me Mii-chan, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:45.65,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,That's what everyone else calls me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:48.52,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Sure. Let's get along, Mii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:50.03,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Let's get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:01.55,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Boy, I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:03.54,Main_Top,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I know. And we finally get to see the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.55,0:16:03.54,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Seriously, I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:08.88,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:10.84,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:12.96,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:15.01,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:18.93,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Um, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:20.22,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:24.06,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Yes, don't concern yourself with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:29.23,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Man, Sakayanagi-chan's pretty cute, \Nbut she's also a total klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:32.19,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,You're the one who tripped her, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:34.36,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.11,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:40.95,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It'll talk to Yamauchi about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:44.62,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Well, I know he didn't do it intentionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:48.29,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,He just tripped me the one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:58.80,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Oh, and although I told you I'd crush you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:17:00.72,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,that will have to wait until later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:04.52,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I've decided to crush Class B first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:08.35,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Class B is a class with strong bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:11.27,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I believe that's the result \Nof the powerful trust
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:15.10,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Ichinose Honami-san has \Nearned from her classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:19.66,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I also know the reason she holds \Na large number of private points
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:24.24,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,is likely because the class is treating \Nher as a bank vault of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:30.58,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,But should they really be \Nleaving their points with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.54,sign_22854_248_Point_Transfer_i,sign,0,0,0,,Point Transfer in Progress
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.54,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0\pos(179.333,181.333)}Ichinose Honami
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:35.21,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't really think Ichinose's \Ngoing to use those points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:38.01,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure she wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:40.80,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,But every person
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.01,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,has a light side
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:45.22,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,and a dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:49.44,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to the time \Nwhen we can fight directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:01.95,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What the heck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:04.58,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,You just dropped this note in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:07.45,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What if someone else had picked it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.37,0:18:11.04,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You wouldn't mess up like that, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.13,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I sure wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:15.34,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,So, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:18.80,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,You want more of my help now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.13,0:18:20.72,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:24.47,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm about to give you some names \Nof people I want you to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:36.44,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,It might be tough, but I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:38.57,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Still, this upcoming exam...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:41.45,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It might get rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:16.02,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,In previous special exams, I always found \Nand exploited some loophole in the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.27,0:19:22.07,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,On the island, I took Horikita out of the \Ngame and took over her role as leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:26.74,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,On the cruise ship, I pulled some \Nsleight-of-hand with the phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:31.87,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,At the sports festival, I intentionally \Nstood out to get attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:38.38,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,In the Paper Shuffle, I arranged \Nthings to cancel out Kushida.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:43.47,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:57.36,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm surprised to see you reaching out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.81,0:20:00.11,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Do you know why I asked to speak to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:02.15,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The Nagumo issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:04.11,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:08.03,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,He already has the second-years \Nin the palm of his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:10.91,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:14.66,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I believe you owe me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:23.51,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I want you to pay it back \Nby taking out Nagumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:26.51,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You can get Suzune into the student council
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.51,0:20:30.01,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,and continue directing her behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:33.47,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's a rather outrageous ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:38.69,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Obviously, I don't expect you to \Ndo everything I want just because
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:40.11,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,you owe me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.77,0:20:45.49,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't have much information \Non the upperclassmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:48.24,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you to an informant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:50.91,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,The student council vice president,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:54.87,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Kiriyama Ikuto of Class 2-B.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.37,0:21:01.71,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,On the surface, he serves Nagumo, \Nbut he's actually collaborating with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:04.48,Main,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,Let me make one thing clear, Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:07.81,Main,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,I have serious doubts about your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.26,0:21:14.02,Main,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,But I'll do what Horikita-senpai tells me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.47,0:21:16.85,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for all the trouble, Kiriyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:20.86,Main,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,No, I will protect the traditions \Nyou passed on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.65,0:21:27.03,Main,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,Nagumo's trying to use his power to \Noverturn the foundations of this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:32.58,Main,Kiriyama,0,0,0,,I expect an unprecedented number \Nof expulsions next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.53,0:21:34.74,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:38.92,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,By the way, what about your \Ncompetition with Nagumo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:41.79,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,It should work itself out without incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:47.67,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,How likely is it that Nagumo will keep \Nhis promise not to involve third parties?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.51,0:21:51.05,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Nagumo is entirely unprincipled \Nin his methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:55.97,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,But he's never broken a promise before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:07.28,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Horikita Manabu might lose this one.
